{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a10757cf-1556-8ab3-b3a3-c1de742d8dec",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:15:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fatima Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:11:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:11:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. I'm calling about a fence. I rent at 17 Old Beach Road, down by Easton's Beach, and I want to put one up in the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:11:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Can I ask what kind of fence you're thinking and how tall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:11:39-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Chain-link. Five feet tall. My neighbor just built a new deck, and it looks right down into my yard now. So I want some privacy. I know chain-link isn't exactly private, but I'm going to look into slats or something for it later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:11:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And you said you rent. Is the owner of the property aware you want to do this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:12:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, my landlord is fine with it. He said go ahead, as long as it's done right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:12:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So my question is, do I need to pull a permit before the guy starts? I have a fence guy lined up, but I don't want him putting posts in the ground and then somebody tells me to take it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:12:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's smart to ask first. In general, yes, a fence usually does need a permit here, and height and location on the lot matter. Five feet is something we'd want to look at. Who would be applying, you or the owner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:12:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, sorry, my phone is on airplane mode, I just noticed. Let me fix that. [pause] Okay, it's off. Sorry, I was getting some weird beeping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:12:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'm on a landline, so I'm fine. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:12:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. To answer you, probably me, but with my landlord's okay. Does it have to be him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:12:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually the property owner signs off, even if the tenant or the contractor is the one doing the legwork. Your fence installer can often handle the application too. I'd just make sure the owner's name is on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:13:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And do I have to notify the neighbor? The one with the deck, I mean. And the other side too, I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:13:17-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. I don't think there's a general requirement that you personally notify neighbors for a standard fence, but I'd want to confirm that for your lot. Do you know roughly where the property line is in the back? Is there a survey?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:13:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have a survey. My landlord might. The old fence posts are still there on one side, but I wouldn't swear that's the line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:13:41-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so that's worth sorting out before anyone digs. If it goes on the line or close to it, that can cause problems with the neighbor even if the city is fine with it. Ask your landlord for the survey or the plot plan. We can also tell you what's on file."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:13:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so I should ask him for that. And then what, I come in with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can bring it in or send it in, along with a simple sketch showing where the fence goes, the height, the material, and where the gates are. Then we review it. Please don't have the installer start until the permit's approved."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:14:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. No digging until it's approved. Is there anything about being near the beach? Like, we just had that nor'easter Friday and Saturday, two days ago. Wind came through pretty hard back there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:14:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can matter, depending on the zone and whether you're in a flood area. I'd have the inspector look at your address when you apply. I can't tell you offhand from here, so that'll come up in the review."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:14:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fair. So, survey, sketch, owner's name, and wait for the permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:14:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Do you want me to note your number in case someone from the office needs to call you back about the neighbor notification question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:14:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:14:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0195. Great. And the address again is 17 Old Beach Road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:15:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:15:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I've got that. Someone will get back to you if there's anything specific on notice. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:15:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:15:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
